{"metadata":{"title":"The Midnight Mystery","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A2"},"content":[["The old clock","struck midnight.","Detective Miller","sat alone","in his dark office.","Rain tapped","against the window.","Suddenly,","the telephone rang.","It was","a strange call.","A trembling voice","whispered words","of warning."],["Someone stole","the silver crown","from the museum.","Miller grabbed","his trench coat.","He rushed out","into the cold night.","The streets","were completely empty.","Only streetlights","cast long shadows","on the wet pavement."],["At the museum,","the glass case","was broken.","Miller searched for","any hidden clues.","He found","a leather glove","on the floor.","It belonged to","a famous thief.","His nickname","was the Phantom."],["The detective","followed the footprints","behind the building.","They led","to an old harbor.","A small boat","waited by","the dark water.","There stood","the Phantom,","holding the crown."],["Miller shouted","stop right there!","The thief tried","to escape quickly.","However,","Miller was faster.","He caught","the criminal.","Justice was served","before sunrise.","The city","was safe again."]]}